4519-b95b-8ed3b918cc60/530be6b0-05ed-4e57-833d-e35bd31ccdab" (reference "#PWR212") (unit 1)))))
(text "RSLATCH_J2N16: gated RS latch. QN = ~((S & E) | Q), Q = ~((R & E) | QN).\nTwo AND-OR-INVERT halves: 6Zh2B (S or R on g1, E on g3) and one triode of the 6N16B on a common plate, Ra 10k.\nEach plate drives the other half's triode through a divider in the cell (470k || 3.9 pF / 200k to -50 V).\nS, R, E: LV (1 = +10 V, 0 = -20 V). Q, QN: HV (1 = +150 V, 0 = +50 V). S = R = 1 with E = 1 is forbidden (Q = QN = 0).\nScreens Rg2 15k from +150 V; Cb 15 pF on each g3 holds E against the plate swing (g3 Miller, sch/logic/NAND2_J2/README.md).\nInput divider C1 per grid: S, R (pentode g1) 2.7 pF; E (two g3) 2 x 6.8 pF. Outputs: one divider per net, 3.9 pF per triode grid.\nSimulated, fanout 2/10: E -> Q 172/368 ns, S -> QN 138/337 ns; E pulse >= 216/454 ns; setup 182/432 ns, hold <= 0.\nHeater 6.3 V: 2 x 0.2 A + 0.4 A on H1/H2. Page: sch/logic/RSLATCH_J2N16/README.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2964905c-0d52-43e0-8598-6af6c7918977"))

(embedded_fonts no))
